  "has_voiceover": false,
  "description": "If a position is NOT working for you...we do not double our efforts",
  "body_html": "<p>Some days are exciting…like last week. Stocks were just going up up up. Yesterday, many of those stocks took a breath. Is this the end? Maybe…but I dont speculate that. When we start seeing random known stocks start pumping again, we go off and search for what we think will follow that trend. Every single week of the last 6 weeks of this bull market, Mondays and sometimes Tuesdays, have been lackluster. So today, I plan on taking a nap, checking the garden, cleaning the chicken coop, playing some video games…heard some good things about Subnautica? The point being…dont double down on your efforts when they are not returning the favor!</p><p>I do think things will turn around…but wait for some signals of that!</p><p>Have a great Tuesday, and if you have questions, Ill see you in the chat!</p><p><em>For more visit: <strong><a href=\"https://www.stocktokdashboard.com/\">StockTokDashboard</a></strong></em> <em><strong>|</strong> <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a></strong></em> <em><strong>| <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a></strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to our StockTok Dashboard, updated daily. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a></strong></em></p>",
